[00:15.46]There’s a warmth I don’t resist
[00:17.58]Not a touch but something close
[00:19.60]It moves under everything
[00:21.40]Soft and slow the way it grows
[00:23.48]I don’t brace I don’t pull back
[00:25.42]I don’t measure what it means
[00:27.36]I just feel it settling
[00:29.06]In the quiet underneath
[00:31.20]No signal no command
[00:35.56]Just light where I stand
[00:46.16]There’s a light under my skin
[00:47.88]Not asking to come in
[00:52.32]It doesn’t rush it doesn’t burn
[00:55.66]It stays and lets me learn
[00:57.48]There’s a light under my skin
[01:00.68]
[01:03.14]Not breaking where I’ve been
